questions.stem:
Explain the role and functions of each of the following industry bodies in the Nigerian insurance sector, and describe how each interacts with NAICOM as the apex regulator:
(a) The Nigerian Insurers Association (NIA);
(b) The Nigerian Council of Registered Insurance Brokers (NCRIB);
(c) The Chartered Insurance Institute of Nigeria (CIIN);
(d) The Institute of Loss Adjusters of Nigeria (ILAN).
